{"strings": [
{"key": "data.lesson.first_market.say.1", "text": "少进点，进准点。新店摆满一整架，不过是让钱干站着。", "src": "Buy narrow. A wide shelf on a new bar is just money standing still."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.0", "text": "六瓶酒加一个酒桶。严格来说，这也算个酒吧。", "src": "Six bottles and a keg. That is a bar, technically."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.1", "text": "倒酒之前先看人 — 酒客证上写着他们来喝什么。", "src": "Read them before you pour — the licence says what they came for."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.0", "text": "收银机里的钱不够交房租。每家店都会碰上一回。", "src": "The till is under the rent. It happens to every room once."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.1", "text": "两回就成了习惯。三回，这家店就只剩你的名字挂在门上了。", "src": "Twice is a habit. Three times is a different bar with your name on it."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.0", "text": "一个雪克壶里装两种烈酒，自己可变不成一杯酒。", "src": "Two spirits in one tin do not become a drink on their own."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.1", "text": "摇和还是搅拌，酒谱上写着呢。", "src": "Shake it or stir it. The book says which."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.0", "text": "门关了。给我倒一杯吧，店里真有的就行。", "src": "Door is shut. Pour me one of whatever we actually have."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.1", "text": "老板开张头一晚。总有地方是这个规矩。", "src": "Owner's first night. It is a rule somewhere."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.declined.0", "text": "你居然拒绝调酒师。胆子不小。", "src": "You are turning down the bartender. Bold."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.nudge.0", "text": "架上随便哪瓶都行。我可不是难伺候的那个。", "src": "Anything on that shelf. I am not the difficult one."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.0", "text": "上周还不存在的店，能调成这样不错了。", "src": "Not bad for a room that did not exist last week."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.1", "text": "后面来的客人会掐着秒数等你。我不会。", "src": "The ones who come after me will count your seconds. I do not."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_wrong.0", "text": "这可不是我要的，而我还是最好说话的那个。", "src": "That is not what I asked for, and I am the easy one."},
{"key": "hud.closed.banner", "text": "酒吧关门了\n连亏三天 — 点“新的一局”再试一次", "src": "THE BAR IS CLOSED\nthree days losing money — NEW RUN to try again"},
